    5. Verify every row has >=1 outline pixel and at least one row has >=2 (guaranteeing fill). Verify min horizontal gap >=2. Verify all non-outline cells in spans are background.
    6. Set grid width = max_outline_col + 1 + randint(0,2) for optional right padding.
    7. Fill all non-outline cells on the grid with background (0).

